    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_19970430.0087\n\nTEHRAN, April 30 , 1997 (AFP)\n\nIran halts dialogue on human rights, terrorism, arms with EU\n\n\n\n\nIran has decided to halt talks with the EU on human rights, terrorism and arms control in retaliation for Europe's suspension of a \"critical dialogue,\" the foreign ministry announced Wednesday.",
